      "type": "text",
      "x": 1194.0691528320312,
      "y": 279.0234375,
      "width": 592.0335693359375,
      "height": 81.25,
      "text": "FOUNDATIONAL MODELS: Text Embedding Models\n• Model A (Default): BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5 (33M params, 384 dims, [CLS] first-token pooling)\n• Model B (Selectable): Qwen/Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B (600M params, 1024 dims, causal last-token\npooling)\n• Runtime: Hugging Face Transformers + CPU PyTorch (no CUDA dependencies)",
      "originalText": "FOUNDATIONAL MODELS: Text Embedding Models\n• Model A (Default): BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5 (33M params, 384 dims, [CLS] first-token pooling)\n• Model B (Selectable): Qwen/Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B (600M params, 1024 dims, causal last-token pooling)\n• Runtime: Hugging Face Transformers + CPU PyTorch (no CUDA dependencies)",
