      "y": 958.9609375,
      "width": 257.92022705078125,
      "height": 81.25,
      "text": "src/rag/index.py & src/rag/bm25.py\n1. Vector Search: `scores = vectors @ q_vec`\n   (Cosine similarity ranking via NumPy)\n2. Keyword Search: `BM25.rank(query)`\n   (Exact term match: pass@k, RRF, Mamba)",
      "originalText": "src/rag/index.py & src/rag/bm25.py\n1. Vector Search: `scores = vectors @ q_vec`\n   (Cosine similarity ranking via NumPy)\n2. Keyword Search: `BM25.rank(query)`\n   (Exact term match: pass@k, RRF, Mamba)",
