      "y": 955.52734375,
      "width": 273.11724853515625,
      "height": 81.25,
      "text": "src/rag/fusion.py (`reciprocal_rank_fusion`)\n• Fuses Vector ranking & BM25 ranking (k=60)\n• Score(d) = sum( 1 / (60 + rank_i) )\n• Returns top-k highest scoring Chunks\n• [--retrieval embeddings skips fusion]",
      "originalText": "src/rag/fusion.py (`reciprocal_rank_fusion`)\n• Fuses Vector ranking & BM25 ranking (k=60)\n• Score(d) = sum( 1 / (60 + rank_i) )\n• Returns top-k highest scoring Chunks\n• [--retrieval embeddings skips fusion]",
