      "y": 1118.3359375,
      "width": 286.7153015136719,
      "height": 97.5,
      "text": "src/rag/prompt.py (`build_prompt`)\n• Formats numbered chunks: `[n] Title › Section`\n• System prompt: Answer ONLY from context\n• Drops lowest-ranked chunks if > 8,192 tokens\n• Breaks Gemma control tokens: `<|think|>` -> `<\n|think|>`",
      "originalText": "src/rag/prompt.py (`build_prompt`)\n• Formats numbered chunks: `[n] Title › Section`\n• System prompt: Answer ONLY from context\n• Drops lowest-ranked chunks if > 8,192 tokens\n• Breaks Gemma control tokens: `<|think|>` -> `< |think|>`",
